  "Commander

  • 190 satellites

  - 9 Weapon Systems

  - 1300 Operations Personnel

  Lt. Col Bryan Bell

  Squadron 1

  - Operates many Satellite Weapons, and R&D satellites

  This Squadron uses and tests many sat weapons.

  Lt. Col Stephen Toth - Squadron 2

  -GPS Tracking Satellites

  Lockheed Martin, Littleton, CO

  Tracks every person in the U.S. GPS Block 3 satellites

  Lt. Col Armon :

  Lansing

  - Squadron 4

  - Relay Satellites - AEHF, WGS, DSCS

  Relay signals to Schriever AFB

  Maj. Sunil Amin _

  • Squadron 22 - Daily Tasking Orders

  Assign tasks to fulfill Space Duty Orders

  Lt. Col. Da vid

  Gallagher

  * SOPS 1,2, & 4 have "Weapons & Tactics" Officers

  that operate the weapon "payloads"

  - Squadron 50 - OSS, Space Duty Orders

  Determines which satellites are

  available for operations today.

  Confession: "AF SPC (Air Force Space Command) is the sole

  provider of positioning, navigation, and timing, as well as the

  bulk of satellite communications to the warfighting community."

  http://www.afspc.af.mil/About-Us/Heritage/2000-2007/

  M.M. in Phoenix -

  20+ satellite attacks

  TARGETED

  JUSTICE

  Bringina ustice to Targeted Individuals

